Package: transmap
Type: Package
Title: Multiscale Mapping of Trans-Regulatory QTL
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Xuewei", "Cao", email = "xc2270@cumc.columbia.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides the development package structure for TransMap, a
    framework for analyzing distal genetic regulation of individual genes and
    coordinated expression programs across cell types. Validated analysis
    functions and examples will be added before release.
